      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:proclus.homily13.budge",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲣⲱⲓⲥ ⲟⲩⲛ ⲛⲧⲉⲧⲉⲛ**ⲥⲱⲟⲩⲛ** ⲅⲁⲣ ⲁⲛ ϫⲉⲁⲣⲉⲡϭⲟⲓⲥ ⲙⲡⲓⲏⲓ ⲛⲏⲟⲩ ⲛⲧⲛⲁⲩ ⲓⲉ ϩⲁⲛⲁⲣⲟⲩϩⲓ ⲓⲉ ⲧⲫⲁϣⲓ ⲙⲡⲓⲉϫⲱⲣϩ ⲓⲉ ⲉⲣⲉⲡⲓⲁⲗⲉⲕⲧⲱⲣ ⲙⲟⲩϯ ⲓⲉ ϩⲁⲛⲁⲧⲟⲟⲩⲓ",
      "english": "Watch therefore, for you don't know when the lord of the house is coming, whether at evening, or at midnight, or when the rooster crows, or in the morning;",
      "source": "Bohairic Gospel of Mark 13 (Digital Edition)",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:nt.mark.bohairic_ed:13",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲛϯ**ⲥⲟⲟⲩⲛ** ⲁⲛ ⲉⲡⲉⲛⲧⲁϥϣⲱⲡⲉ ⲙⲙⲟⲕ ϩⲛⲟⲩϭⲉⲡⲏ ·",
      "english": "I know not what hath happened unto thee suddenly.'",
