      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:lives.john_kalybites.budge:1-45",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲁϥϣⲟⲡⲟⲩ ⲇⲉ ⲉⲣⲟϥ ϧⲉⲛⲟⲩⲣⲁϣⲓ ⲙⲉⲛⲧⲟⲓ ⲙⲡⲉϥ**ⲥⲟⲩⲱⲛ**ⲟⲩ .",
      "english": "The old man received them with joy, but he did not recognize them.",
